      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether petitioner proves that he sustained grievous injuries in the accident took place on 18.02.2017 at about 8-00 P.M., near Rajathadripura gate, Kibbanahalli Hobli, NC: 2024:KHC:29142 Tiptur Taluk was due to rash and negligent riding of"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cf940ddad59b4a1c864a1fcaa47f15c3_17",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n2. Whether the petitioner prove that he is entitle for any compensation?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5420b59c1eb64d53b19617e72c87e78d_18",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If so, to what extent and from whom?\n3. What order or decree?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ee6dde1e16ac43e796e824e4f2669be6_21",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7. After hearing the arguments, the Tribunal allowed the petition in part and awarded Global Compensation of Rs.64,000/- and holding there was a Contributory Negligence on the part of the rider and deducted 20% towards the Contributory Negl"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b253233aa50149ff95ae40d31a60e7b3_27",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 73,
          "end": 82
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "Hence, AIR 2020 SCC 520 NC:\n2024:KHC:29142 prayed for enhancement and to set aside the Contributory Negligence on the part of the claimant."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7390225f7f254a769ad272e1ad1ebbc2_28",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. Having heard the arguments, perused the records the point that arises for my consideration is:\n1. Whether Tribunal is justified in fastening the Contributory Negligence of 20% on the claimant and 80% on the KSRTC Bus.?\n2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3c5f106a6035480399a807e4d41e92c6_29",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether the appellant is entitled for enhancement of compensation?"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b0ddaf20a5354246a487411d5b5aeaf2_30",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If so, at what extent?\nSri Arunkumar H G vs The Managing Director on 24 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/173835127/\n3 12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "54f1b654d38f4c2eb183f9e16b331dfe_31",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On perusal of the records, especially the FIR and the complaint as well as the Charge sheet,\nwhich clearly reveal the Bus came in the opposite direction extreme on the right side and dashed against the Motorcycle, where two persons were suc"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6be9392a33db4b068ca092256943de54_32",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The police, after the investigation, filed the Charge sheet against the driver of the KSRTC Bus but not the rider of the Motorcycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0b53dbf97b9c4aa3b29d21a90e08a8b5_33",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Panchanama and FIR clearly reveal that this accident NC: 2024:KHC:29142 occurred due to the negligence of the KSRTC Bus."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5ee5ade1306f43d4b8faaf6c57f14766_34",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the Tribunal has considered three persons were traveling on the Motorcycle, therefore, there was Contributory Negligence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "44978a55966d4fb6831f6c7d091e605b_35",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, the Hon'ble Supreme Court in the case of Mohammed Siddique (Supra) at para 13 has held under:\n13."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7c1bc159be864978b7e1500a9a6bc5fc_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the above reason, in our view, is flawed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "102dff0d8868426e83ea4e1093906a27_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact that the deceased was riding on a motor cycle along with the driver and another, may not, by itself, without anything more, make him guilty of contributory negligence: At the most it would make him guilty of being a party to the vi"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e08da683067c4d399adc36ec7fda4126_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 128 of the Motor Vehicles Act. 1988, imposes a restriction on the driver of a two wheeled motor cycle, not to carry more than one person on the motor cycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8d7482791f4248b0a2f029afc535d224_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 194C inserted by the Amendment Act 32 of 2019, prescribes a penalty for violation of safety measures for motor cycle drivers and pillion riders."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a4fe765469344b79851531253a64b687_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the fact that a person was a pillion rider on a motor cycle along with the driver and one more person on the pillion, may be a violation of the law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2d879ac52986457fa70d5505c2c09fa0_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But such violation by itself, without anything more, cannot lead to a finding of contributory negligence, unless it is established that his very act of riding along with two others, contributed either to the accident or to the impact of the"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cf58e681fbc94d56a11532cf19351015_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There must either be a causal connection between the violation and the accident or a causal connection between the violation and the impact of the accident upon the victim."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "59d93e106af849a383acc673a44f21e7_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It may so happen at times, that the accident could have been averted or the injuries sustained could have been of a lesser degree, if there had been no violation of the law by the victim."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0337899f4e8a4440be19281376eafd10_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "What could otherwise have resulted in a simple injury, might have resulted in a grievous injury or even death due to the violation of the law by the victim."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "202eb69125774dd789407a276bb877a1_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is in such cases, where, but for the violation of the law, either the accident could have NC: 2024:KHC:29142 been averted or the impact could have been minimized, that the principle of contributory negligence could be invoked."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "920ec1c126724ffe864f4779863e2cae_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is not the case of the insurer that the accident itself occurred as a result of three persons riding on a motor cycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1d2725d7e4224149887e4581f56b8363_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is not even the case of the insurer that the accident would have been averted, if three persons were not riding on the motor cycle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6bc9fbff1e5c4292babe201d88f8cb2b_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact that the motor cycle was hit by the car from behind, is admitted."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "41a749a1bcd6486bb0a047210ba94980_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Interestingly, the finding recorded by the Tribunal that the deceased was wearing a helmet and that the deceased was knocked down after the car hit the motor cycle from behind, are all not assailed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "048476f1f4154758afd59f7ddb6099fa_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the finding of the High Court that 2 persons on the pillion of the motor cycle, could have added to the imbalance, is nothing but presumptuous and is not based either upon pleading or upon the evidence on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "354aec8f39a74f5290383720f3d38621_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Nothing was extracted from PW3 to the effect that 2 persons on the pillion added to the imbalance.\""
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a76c08ac808c4e17936574320105bc61_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. In view of the judgment of the Hon'ble Supreme Court, even though the three persons travelled in the Motorcycle, it is a violation of the traffic rules, but it cannot be said there is a Contributory Negligence on the part of the rider o"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2ead235052fd4487b25147429ff3b0ff_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, when the Charge sheet, FIR, and other evidence of the petitioner clearly reveal this accident occurred due to the negligence of the driver of the Bus."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "581c5904f44e49a9b4a3f5aacc4ecef4_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Such being the case, holding 20% of the Contributory Negligence on the rider of the Motorcycle is not correct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d2358f12ae6244d8b8f533d3f07faa42_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
        "explicit_leakage_phrase"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [
        {
          "pattern": "\\bset\\s+aside\\b",
          "matched_text": "set aside",
          "start": 210,
          "end": 219
        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the finding of the Tribunal in respect of Contributory Sri Arunkumar H G vs The Managing Director on 24 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/173835127/\n4 Negligence is liable to be set aside, and 100% NC: 2024:K"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9eb591b831a242b9b82d9ea0231ebf15_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, I answered Issue No.1 in favour of the claimant and against the KSRTC."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "100c5d6f47aa4137a07e613b81fca7b0_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. As regards the computation of compensation, as per the evidence of the Doctor, the petitioner suffered fractured injuries on both the bones, tibia and fibula."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7f819f191aa7461ebe9238d3af608e03_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He was admitted in the Hospital for 15 days, and he underwent surgery."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eda95f5efa8644038d29576f1af9b49c_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
