        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, this being evidence of the claimant as well as the Doctor is not correct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e829cdea81f34f58b48349772512e66a_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "For the fracture injuries, the claimant was admitted in the Hospital for 15 days."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7bed5f3ecb964a62af269467927f9d81_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the question of awarding Global Compensation is not correct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "07c1ed082fdc44e38f8dfb6794d98890_63",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
